                      "fill": "#2A3157",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 620,
                      "content": "Dark sections use Thin, Frost and Signal. Light sections use Mist, with the same light streaks faded to pale blue and a glow or sphere behind each group of cards, so the blur always has something to show.",
